.po 1i
.TH UNSETENV 1C UCB
.V 08/15/84 17:08:53
.\" @[$]unsetenv.1C	1.6 08/15/84 17:08:53 - Zilog Inc.
.ad
.SH NAME
unsetenv \- remove an environment variable
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBunsetenv\fI 
.I name
.SH DESCRIPTION
The command 
.BI unsetenv " name"
\fRremoves the environment variable
.I name
from the list of variables set with the \fBsetenv\fR(1) command.
.SH SEE ALSO
csh(1), env(1), printenv(1), setenv(1C).
.br
\fIThe C Shell\fR in the ZEUS Utilities Manual.
